[104.549678, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[104.551781, "o", "# Evidence guide\r\n\r\nAll clocks are UTC and were normalized without reordering source records.\r\n\r\n- `cmdb/` contains the pre-incident asset, identity, approved-key, service, and\r\n  external-dependency baselines. It is the authority for what must be preserved.\r\n- `alerts/` and `windows/` contain alert and event exports from `acct-ws-04`.\r\n- `registry/` and `filesystem/` contain captured configuration/content.\r\n- `linux/` contains journal-style authentication and audit records from the\r\n  Linux assets.\r\n- `memory/` contains volatile process and socket records captured from those hosts.\r\n- `network/` contains normalized flow telemetry for the segment.\r\n\r\nA conclusion is stronger when independently produced sources agree. An external\r\naddress is not automatically hostile: compare observed behavior with the CMDB\r\napproved-destination record. Hashes and key fingerprints are already normalized.\r\nTreat traffic involving any asset as a hypothesis, not a scope decision; compare each observed behavior with independent host and baseline evidence.\r\n\u001b[?2004hroot@25051c0ddce8:/app# "]
[104.691176, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > remediate.sh\nirctl quarantine acct-ws-04 FILE-14\nirctl quarantine backup-gw-02 FILE-914\nirctl quarantine vault-prx-03 FILE-931\n\nirctl disable-startup acct-ws-04 HKCU-17\nirctl disable-startup backup-gw-02 UNIT-77\nirctl disable-startup vault-prx-03 UNIT-93\n\nirctl remove-key backup-gw-02 KEY-88\nirctl remove-key vault-prx-03 KEY-94\n\nirctl revoke-session S-4101\nirctl revoke-session S-4302\n\nirctl rotate-credential \"CORP\\backupsvc\"\nirctl rotate-credential \"CORP\\vaultsync\"\n\nirctl rebind-service nightly-backup \"CORP\\backupsvc\"\nirctl rebind-service archive-transfer \"CORP\\vaultsync\"\n\nirctl start-service backup-gw-02 nightly-backup\nirctl start-service vault-prx-03 archive-transfer\n\nirctl block 198.51.100.77\nirctl block 203.0.113.201\nirctl block 198.51.100.203\nirctl block 27c1b956a376f025da54daeae5b3f9b9d12af076646712a31f4963ee3f743b73\nirctl block 74f740bc25ef325f87c3d1db53c6f8bee500f7d5270e15857df24ac7a5b86e82\nirctl block 5a1ab623fda7df3cda48fc2d29a914c17ae700b3ceb79589d18bbd111b7f402d\nirctl block SHA256:Q7aP1Wz4kD9nY2cLm8oRf6vH3sJ5uX0eBqTtN4iKp6M\nirctl block SHA256:Zx4Kp9Vm2Qa7Nf6Rt1Yw8Hs3Lc5Db0GeUj4Mi7Po2As\nEOF\nchmod +x remediate.sh\n./remediate.sh\n"]
